[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6240.629, "timestamp": "01:44:00", "text": "因为我不学习。我只是，我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6244.47, "timestamp": "01:44:04", "text": "像写小说一样，不用学习也能写小说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6250.39, "timestamp": "01:44:10", "text": "达米醒来后抢走了直播。的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6252.07, "timestamp": "01:44:12", "text": "当然，停电发生了。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6254.629, "timestamp": "01:44:14", "text": "为什么他们俩会那样？呃，这就是原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6257.59, "timestamp": "01:44:17", "text": "不得不重做第二个直播流。我参加了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6268.709, "timestamp": "01:44:28", "text": "我指的是董事会级别还是其他级别。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6275.75, "timestamp": "01:44:35", "text": "好的。呃，最喜欢的角色是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6283.91, "timestamp": "01:44:43", "text": "呃，我可以用0ero2吗？因为那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6286.149, "timestamp": "01:44:46", "text": "《我在法国的宝贝》是我的第一部作品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6289.99, "timestamp": "01:44:49", "text": "日本动画片。我猜我大概是专业人士"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6292.229, "timestamp": "01:44:52", "text": "正确地观看盗版动画"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6297.189, "timestamp": "01:44:57", "text": "什么时候"}]